    "description": "# RF-2: Contact Fields\n\n_Referrer's contact details — primary email, phone, and the payout-adjacent E-Transfer Email._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Primary Email\n* Phone\n* E-Transfer Email\n\n* Renamed from Secondary Email — Joyce Kiddell, [1:38:06](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5886): \"Just rename the secondary to e-transfer email.\" Kobi Kunasekaran, [1:38:09](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5889): \"Yep. Okay.\"\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Preferred Contact Method removed\n\n* Matches the same cut made on the Brand Ambassador record — Joyce Kiddell, [1:37:08](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5828): \"You can probably take out preferred contact method, because we don't have that for BAs anymore.\"\n\n* Prototype not yet updated for either change\n\n* The Netlify prototype still shows a Secondary Email field and a Preferred Contact Method field — build to this ticket, not the prototype.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-2 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-2 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:38:06 (E-Transfer rename)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5886)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:37:08 (Preferred Contact Method cut)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5828)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
